I'm interested in estimating a Zero-inflated Poisson-IRT model (https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.3102/1076998610375838) to estimate the structure of a set of count variables. I was wondering whether it might be possible to implement this item type. It's not immediately clear to me whether the Poisson part of the model (Equations 1a and 1b in the linked paper) can be implemented using the `createItem()` function.

