Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

In the documentation:

- group: a character vector indicating group membership

So group should be a character vector to indicate the membership. Modify your code to the following to make it work:

sex.model.constrained <- multipleGroup(data = df.sex[,1:14], model = mode.single, group = as.character(df.sex[,15]), invariance = c(colnames(df.sex[,1:14]), 'free_means', "free_var"))

HTH.

Phil

